  "notes": [
    "vs.AddSymToWall with the plug-in name Door or Window inserts a plug-in object of type 86 whose parent is the wall. The IFC export writes it as IfcDoor or IfcWindow with an IfcOpeningElement. building.wall.with_door_window inserts the same plug-ins inside symbols, and its IFC file holds the wall only."
